  {
    "id": "ja-kinsoku-unresolved-001",
    "category": "kinsoku",
    "description": "全文字が行頭禁止の場合 kinsoku_unresolved になること。boundtext は max_width 内に収めるため強制改行し kinsoku_unresolved を報告する。ブラウザ (line-break:strict) は改行機会なしと判断しオーバーフローする。また Chromium は text-spacing-trim:normal により連続句読点を半幅圧縮するため見た目の文字幅も異なる（既知差異）。",
    "request": {
      "text": "。。。。。。。。",
      "font_family": "NotoSansJP",
      "font_size_px": 24,
      "max_width": 50,
      "max_height": 200,
      "wrap": "Word",
      "fit": "None",
      "language": "Ja",
      "writing_mode": "HorizontalTb",
      "line_height": 1.5,
      "letter_spacing_px": 0,
      "hanging_punctuation": false
    },
    "expected": {
      "overflow": "kinsoku_unresolved",
      "line_count": 4,
      "break_indices": [2, 4, 6],
      "_browser_incomparable": true,
      "_note": "Browsers do not break all-head-prohibit sequences (no break opportunity under line-break:strict). boundtext force-breaks to respect max_width. Chromium also applies text-spacing-trim:normal compressing consecutive CJK punctuation to half-width."
    }
  }
